        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.2762813>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1523/JNEUROSCI.06-08-02117.1986> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-miller-ocular-dominance-stripes-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-miller-ocular-dominance-stripes-model-fidelity>,
